			"notes": "Initial release of Super Snowmen, adding a dedicated upgrade interface and extensive combat customization for snow golems.\n\n## Downloads\n\n- `super_snowmen-1.20.1-1.0.0.jar` — Minecraft 1.20.1, Forge 47.4.10, Java 17\n- `super_snowmen-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar` — Minecraft 1.21.1, NeoForge 21.1.235, Java 21\n\nInstall the JAR matching your Minecraft version and mod loader on both the client and server.\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Dedicated snow golem upgrade GUI\n- Base upgrades, projectile plugins, and special ice upgrades\n- 20 projectile slots supporting arrows, fireballs, TNT, potions, tridents, sonic booms, evoker fangs, fireworks, and more\n- Bow, Crossbow, and Lightning Rod synergies\n- Configurable projectile consumption and damage-cooldown bypass\n- English and Simplified Chinese localization\n\nSee the repository README for complete usage and configuration documentation.\n\n## SHA-256\n\n- `super_snowmen-1.20.1-1.0.0.jar`: `E20CB7291C2BA8737814EF0623749C3495E3270D2576B32E424DF276B88F7D34`\n- `super_snowmen-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar`: `9780F56A81356F471318A66CE4D65F0B6AF15675CAEF8308B893C5DA3B3A923E`"
